      <p><seg source="#source-741-780">玄道先生唯今御入来相成候、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-780-807"><rb>依而</rb><rt>（よつて）</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-807-816">雅兄早</seg><g ref="#gaiji-1-2-22" source="#source-816-849">〻</g><seg source="#source-849-855">御出</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-855-900"><rb><seg source="#source-858-861">被</seg><note type="kunten" subtype="return-mark" rend="subscript" source="#source-861-873">レ</note><seg source="#source-873-876">下</seg></rb><rt>（くだされ）</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-900-924">ず候てハ、天下の</seg><seg type="annotated-text" source="#source-927-975"><seg source="#source-924-927">儀</seg><note type="gloss"><seg source="#source-948-960">（ママ）</seg></note></seg><seg source="#source-975-978">論</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-978-1005"><rb>初</rb><rt>（はじま）</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1005-1025">りかね申候。</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-1025-1078">何卒御足おすゝめさせたまへと申すハ</seg></p>
      <div type="layout" source="#source-1078-1136" style="padding-inline-start: 2em">
        <p><seg source="#source-1099-1108">十六日</seg><seg type="layout" source="#source-1108-1136" rend="chitsuki align(right) offset-from-end(0)" snh:layout-kind="chitsuki" snh:layout-params="align=right;offset-from-end=0"><seg source="#source-1126-1136">龍馬</seg></seg></p>
      </div>
