        <p style="text-indent: 1em" rend="first-line-indent(1)"><seg source="#source-1136-1151">伊藤先生</seg><seg type="layout" source="#source-1151-1177" rend="chitsuki align(right) offset-from-end(0)" snh:layout-kind="chitsuki" snh:layout-params="align=right;offset-from-end=0"><seg source="#source-1169-1177">坂本</seg></seg></p>
